      "beat_id": "B05",
      "narration_text": "Why did the simple model win? One D spatial data is straightforward. Complex models like Transformers had excess capacity and just memorized the background noise. The shallow CNN acted as a natural bottleneck, capturing only the vital chemical peaks.",
